<li about="#cite_note-23" id="cite_note-23" data-mw-footnote-number="23"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwBX4"><a href="#cite_ref-23" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwBX8"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwBYA">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-23" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt119" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwBYE" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"cite web ","href":"./Template:Cite_web"},"params":{"title":{"wt":"Porosity of Small Bodies and a {{sic|nolink=y|reason=error in source|Reassesment}} of Ida&apos;s Density"},"url":{"wt":"http://www.aas.org/publications/baas/v31n4/dps99/65.htm"},"quote":{"wt":"When the error bars are taken into account, only one of these, Phobos, has a porosity below 0.2..."},"archive-url":{"wt":"https://web.archive.org/web/20070926224539/http://www.aas.org/publications/baas/v31n4/dps99/65.htm"},"archive-date":{"wt":"26 September 2007"}},"i":0}}]}'/><cite class="citation web cs1" about="#mwt119" id="mwBYI"><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20070926224539/http://www.aas.org/publications/baas/v31n4/dps99/65.htm" class="external text" id="mwBYM">"Porosity of Small Bodies and a Reassesment<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwBYQ"> </span><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwBYU">[</span><i id="mwBYY">sic</i><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwBYc">]</span> of Ida's Density"</a>. Archived from <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="http://www.aas.org/publications/baas/v31n4/dps99/65.htm" class="external text" id="mwBYg">the original</a> on 26 September 2007. <q id="mwBYk">When the error bars are taken into account, only one of these, Phobos, has a porosity below 0.2...</q></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.ge