%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Icarus&amp;rft.atitle=Evolution+of+the+water+regime+of+Phobos&amp;rft.volume=88&amp;rft.issue=2&amp;rft.pages=380-395&amp;rft.date=1990-12&amp;rft_id=info%3Adoi%2F10.1016%2F0019-1035%2890%2990089-R&amp;rft_id=info%3Abibcode%2F1990Icar...88..380F&amp;rft.aulast=Fanale&amp;rft.aufirst=Fraser+P.&amp;rft.au=Salvail%2C+James+R.&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3APhobos+%28moon%29" class="Z3988" about="#mwt137" id="mwBdI"></span></span></li>
