wrap" id="mwBqs">16 October</span> 2008</span>.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=Mars+Express+closes+in+on+the+origin+of+Mars%27+larger+moon&amp;rft.pub=DLR&amp;rft.date=2008-10-16&amp;rft_id=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.dlr.de%2Fmars%2Fen%2Fdesktopdefault.aspx%2Ftabid-207%2F422_read-13776%2F&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3APhobos+%28moon%29" class="Z3988" about="#mwt205" id="mwBqw"></span></span></li>
